  "content": "[Intro]\n[Edim]\n\n[Interlude]\n[E7#9]\n[G]  [A]\n[E7#9]\n[G]  [A]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E7#9]Purple haze, all\n[G]in my brain [A]\n[E7#9]Lately things they don't\n[G]seem the same [A]\n[E7#9]Actin' funny, but I\n[G]don't know why [A]\n[E7#9]Excuse me while I\nkiss the sky\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E7#9]Purple haze,\n[G]all around [A]\n[E7#9]Don't know if I'm comin'\n[G]up or down [A]\n[E7#9]Am I happy or\n[G]in misery? [A]What\n[E7#9]ever it is, that girl put a\nspell on me\n[A]Help me\n[B]Help me\n[D]Oh, no, no\n\n[Solo]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n\n[Interlude]\n[E7#9]Ooo,\nahhh\nOoo,\nahhh\nOoo,\nahhh\nOoo,\nahhh, yeah!\n\n[Verse 3]\n[E7#9]Purple haze all\n[G]in my [A]eyes\n[E7#9]Don't know if it's\n[G]day or night [A]\n[E7#9]You got me blowin',\n[G]blowin' my mind [A]Is it\n[E7#9]tomorrow, or just the\nend of time?\n\n[Outro]\n[A]\n[B]\n[D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n\n[Fade Out]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]\n[E7#9]\n[F#]  [D]",
